  caution: '角度は 10〜20° 程度に。急すぎると上と下の時差が大きく文字が崩れて見える。clip-path の polygon は開始と終了で頂点数をそろえる。', cautionEn: 'Keep the angle around 10–20°; steeper edges split the timing of tops and bottoms too much. Keep the polygon vertex count equal at both ends.',
  values: ['edge angle ~15°', '0.7s expo.out', '語ごと 120ms', 'polygon 4 点'], valuesEn: ['edge angle ~15°', '0.7s expo.out', '120ms per word', '4-point polygon'],
  duration: 700, easing: 'expo.out', feel: ['きびきび', '硬質'], use: ['見出し', '映像', '広告'],
  recipes: {
    css: `.cut { clip-path: polygon(0 0, 0 0, -20% 100%, -20% 100%);\n  animation: cut .7s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1) forwards; }\n@keyframes cut { to { clip-path: polygon(0 0, 120% 0, 100% 100%, -20% 100%); } }\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .cut { animation: none; clip-path: none; } }`,
    gsap: `gsap.fromTo('.word', { clipPath: 'polygon(0% 0%, 0% 0%, -20% 100%, -20% 100%)' },\n  { clipPath: 'polygon(0% 0%, 120% 0%, 100% 100%, -20% 100%)', duration: .7, ease: 'expo.out', stagger: .12 });`,
    ae: '1. テキストにエフェクト → トランジション → リニアワイプ\n2. ワイプ角度 105°（垂直から 15° 傾ける）、境界のぼかし 0〜2px\n3. 変換終了 100% → 0%（0.7 秒、ease out 強め）\n4. 細いシェイプのバーを同じ角度で置き、ワイプの境目に合わせて動かす',
    aeEn: '1. Effect → Transition → Linear Wipe on the text\n2. Wipe Angle 105° (15° off vertical), Feather 0–2 px\n3. Transition Completion 100% → 0% over 0.7 s, strong ease out\n4. A thin shape bar at the same angle following the wipe edge'
  }
